WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.034 --> 00:00:02.302
-Good evening.
I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.302 --> 00:00:03.736
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.171
And now, if you don't mind,
we're gonna get to the news.

00:00:05.171 --> 00:00:07.507
President Biden attacked
former President Trump yesterday

00:00:07.507 --> 00:00:09.475
for calling his opponents
"vermin"

00:00:09.475 --> 00:00:12.212
and said, quote, "Damn,
he shouldn't be president."

00:00:12.212 --> 00:00:13.646
Of course he shouldn't
be president,

00:00:13.646 --> 00:00:15.982
but that's what you're using
as evidence?

00:00:15.982 --> 00:00:18.751
How about the four years
he was president?

00:00:18.751 --> 00:00:20.252
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.252 --> 00:00:22.422
The White House yesterday
released the fifth

00:00:22.422 --> 00:00:23.956
National Climate Assessment.

00:00:23.956 --> 00:00:25.625
And if you're wondering
how things are going,

00:00:25.625 --> 00:00:28.461
they said
don't expect a sixth.

00:00:28.461 --> 00:00:31.464
[ Laughter ]

00:00:31.464 --> 00:00:33.833
House Speaker Mike Johnson
yesterday defended former

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.269
President Trump's false claims
that the election was stolen

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:38.171
and said, quote,
"I take him at his word.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.172
I do believe
that he believes that."

00:00:40.172 --> 00:00:43.676
Which is absolutely
the smoothest way

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:46.012
to call someone crazy.

00:00:46.012 --> 00:00:47.747
My wife does that to me
all the time.

00:00:47.747 --> 00:00:49.415
I'll be like,
"Hey, I'm a great husband!"

00:00:49.415 --> 00:00:52.418
"I believe
that you believe that."

00:00:52.418 --> 00:00:54.887
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.887 --> 00:00:56.555
Former House Speaker
Kevin McCarthy

00:00:56.555 --> 00:00:58.491
denied claims yesterday
that he elbowed

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:00.860
Republican Congressman
Tim Burchett in the back

00:01:00.860 --> 00:01:02.996
and added, quote,
"If I would hit somebody,

00:01:02.996 --> 00:01:04.430
they would know I hit them."

00:01:04.430 --> 00:01:07.033
I assume 'cause his fist
would bruise.

00:01:07.033 --> 00:01:09.168
[ Laughter ]

00:01:09.168 --> 00:01:10.503
The House...

00:01:10.503 --> 00:01:13.506
[ Laughing ]

00:01:13.506 --> 00:01:14.707
Just, like...

00:01:14.707 --> 00:01:16.209
Just, like, a weird case

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:19.145
where I don't know
if we needed to see it.

00:01:19.145 --> 00:01:21.480
You know, I think if we all
just, like, in our heads,

00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:26.352
pictured a bruised fist, not one
of them would be that weird.

00:01:26.352 --> 00:01:29.021
[ Laughter ]

00:01:29.021 --> 00:01:31.190
Bummer is we sent one
of our writers out

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:33.059
to just punch a wall.

00:01:33.059 --> 00:01:36.062
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:38.097
The House yesterday passed
a temporary

00:01:38.097 --> 00:01:40.766
government funding bill
that does not include any aid

00:01:40.766 --> 00:01:42.201
for Ukraine or Israel,

00:01:42.201 --> 00:01:44.070
or, frankly, the US.

00:01:44.070 --> 00:01:45.571
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.571 --> 00:01:48.407
Democratic Senator Joe Manchin
said in an interview yesterday

00:01:48.407 --> 00:01:50.843
that he can't vote next year
for former President Trump.

00:01:50.843 --> 00:01:53.179
Wow, that could really hurt
Trump's chances

00:01:53.179 --> 00:01:55.181
in West Virginia.

00:01:55.181 --> 00:01:56.882
[ Laughter ]

00:01:56.882 --> 00:01:58.718
The US Postal Service yesterday

00:01:58.718 --> 00:02:01.720
reported a $6.5 billion loss
for the year,

00:02:01.720 --> 00:02:04.891
but they got a bold plan
to make it all back.

00:02:04.891 --> 00:02:07.693
[ Laughter ]

00:02:07.693 --> 00:02:10.362
Hey, it just takes one.

00:02:10.362 --> 00:02:12.565
Just takes one sucker.

00:02:13.766 --> 00:02:15.668
Alaska Senator Lisa Murkowski

00:02:15.668 --> 00:02:18.037
criticized Utah Senator
Mitt Romney in a new interview,

00:02:18.037 --> 00:02:20.039
for eating salmon
with ketchup.

00:02:20.039 --> 00:02:23.710
To be fair, that's the spiciest
dish you can get in Utah.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.712
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.712 --> 00:02:28.514
The restaurant chain Chili's
yesterday released an ad

00:02:28.514 --> 00:02:31.184
that features a new version
of its jingle "Baby Back Ribs,"

00:02:31.184 --> 00:02:33.820
performed by the R&amp;B group
Boyz II Men.

00:02:33.820 --> 00:02:36.823
Sounds like Boyz II Men
has got "billz II pay."

00:02:36.823 --> 00:02:39.225
[ Laughter ]

00:02:42.461 --> 00:02:45.131
Says the guy
who did a Verizon ad.

00:02:45.131 --> 00:02:46.799
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.799 --> 00:02:49.102
[Bleep] on my high horse.

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:51.604
[ Laughter ]

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:53.840
Former Vice President
Mike Pence yesterday

00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:56.041
released a new book titled
"Go Home for Dinner."

00:02:56.041 --> 00:02:59.045
Look for it wherever tables
are a little crooked.

00:02:59.045 --> 00:03:01.280
[ Laughter ]

00:03:01.280 --> 00:03:03.282
[ Applause ]

00:03:03.282 --> 00:03:05.752
That's right, Mike Pence
released a new book,

00:03:05.752 --> 00:03:07.753
titled "Go Home for Dinner."

00:03:07.753 --> 00:03:09.088
I guess it's no surprise

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:11.257
he thinks eating out is a sin.

00:03:11.257 --> 00:03:13.626
[ Laughter and groans ]

00:03:18.798 --> 00:03:21.300
Bruised a couple of fists
with that one.

00:03:21.300 --> 00:03:22.969
[ Laughter ]

00:03:22.969 --> 00:03:25.204
And finally, New York state
education officials

00:03:25.204 --> 00:03:28.007
are reportedly considering
dropping the Regents Exams

00:03:28.007 --> 00:03:30.810
as a high school graduation
requi-- requirement, excuse me.

00:03:30.810 --> 00:03:33.145
While Massachusetts high schools
are considering

00:03:33.145 --> 00:03:34.480
dropping the breathalyzer.

00:03:34.480 --> 00:03:36.315
[ Laughter ]
And that...

00:03:36.315 --> 00:03:39.752
was written by a dude from
Massachusetts -- Scollins!

